{"id":"temporal","lemma":"temporal","pos":"adj","rank":2085,"glosses":["temporal (of or relating to time)","temporary","temporal (of the temples of the head)"],"ipa":"/tempoˈɾal/","forms":{"femininePlural":"temporales"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/0b/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-temporal.wav","examples":[{"text":"Es sólo una solución temporal.","en":"It's only a temporary solution.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/606504","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null,{"g":"a"},{"g":"solution"},null]},{"text":"Vas a necesitar un puente temporal.","en":"You'll need a temporary bridge.","words":[{"g":"to go","l":"ir"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"to need"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"bridge"},null]},{"text":"No te preocupes, es solo temporal.","en":"Don't worry. It's only temporary.","words":[null,null,null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"sole"},null],"phrases":[[0,3,"don't worry"]]},{"text":"Le aseguro que esto solo es temporal.","en":"I assure you this is only temporary.","words":[{"g":"him / her"},{"g":"to secure (to make fast","l":"asegurar"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"this"},{"g":"sole"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null]},{"text":"Esa es solamente una solución temporal.","en":"That's only a temporary solution.","words":[{"g":"that","l":"ese"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"only, alone, merely"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"solution"},null]}]}